msgid ""
"Replace ``SESSION_ID`` below with the ``session_id`` returned by ``session "
"start`` or ``session list``."
msgstr ""
"Zamień ``SESSION_ID`` poniżej na ``session_id`` zwrócony przez ``session "
"start`` lub ``session list``."

